## Dataset Description

The project uses a household financial transactions dataset containing over 400,000 records.

The dataset includes:

- Household identifiers
- Transaction identifiers
- Account identifiers
- Transaction dates
- Transaction types and classifications
- Transaction categories and families
- Inflow and outflow indicators
- Transaction values in KES and USD
- Observation periods

The original raw dataset was preserved to maintain data integrity throughout the pipeline.

An important analytical consideration was distinguishing actual household income from other cash inflows.

